Package: reiof
Title: Dietary Environmental Impact Metrics from the Intake EIOF Framework
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = c("Nicholus", "Tint"),
           family = "Zaw",
           email = "n.t.zaw@cgiar.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates the dietary environmental impact metrics defined in
    Intake's Environmental Impacts of Foods methods paper: absolute threshold
    metrics against per capita planetary boundary shares, relative benchmark
    metrics against a fixed global reference distribution, and the two
    composite metrics that combine diet quality with environmental impact.
    Cut-offs are age- and sex-specific. The package does not contain the
    Environmental Impacts of Foods database itself; it applies the published
    metric cut-offs to impact values the user has already derived. Includes a
    data quality check suite covering variable type, plausibility, numerical
    precision and unit magnitude.
